  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xe9;sultats obtenus &#xe0; la fin du projet en ao&#xfb;t 2023 : S&#xe9;n&#xe9;gal :  1) 168 participantes ont pris part au Programme d&#x2019;&#xe9;veil &#xe0; l&#x2019;entrepreneuriat, dont 135 &#xe9;taient des jeunes femmes scolaris&#xe9;es et 33 des jeunes femmes en situation de vuln&#xe9;rabilit&#xe9;; 2) 55 jeunes femmes, dont 53  issues du Programme d&#x2019;&#xe9;veil &#xe0; l&#x2019;entrepreneuriat et 2 de l&#x2019;Universit&#xe9; communautaire ont re&#xe7;u l&#x2019;appui  dans le cadre du Programme de soutien technique et financier; Burkina Faso : 1) 225 participantes et participants ont pris part au Programme d&#x2019;&#xe9;veil &#xe0; l&#x2019;entrepreneuriat, notamment 100 jeunes femmes et 50 jeunes hommes en milieu scolaire ainsi que 75 filles en situation de vuln&#xe9;rabilit&#xe9;; 2) 85 jeunes femmes ont re&#xe7;u un appui dans le cadre du Programme de soutien technique et financier.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved at the end of the project (August 2023) include: Senegal: (1) 168 participants took part in the entrepreneurship awareness training program, of whom 135 were young women in school and 33 young women in vulnerable situations; (2) 55 young women, including 53 from the entrepreneurship awareness training program and 2 from the community university, received support under the technical and financial support program; Burkina Faso: (1) 225 participants (men and women) took part in the entrepreneurship awareness training program, including 100 young women and 50 young men in schools, as well as 75 girls in vulnerable situations; (2) 85 young women received support under the technical and financial support program.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xe9;sultats escompt&#xe9;s de ce projet comprennent: 1) confiance accrue des jeunes femmes de Ouagadougou et de Gu&#xe9;diawaye en leur potentiel entrepreneurial; 2) engagement (attitude favorable) accru des acteurs communautaires pour l&#x2019;entrepreneuriat f&#xe9;minin et le travail d&#xe9;cent des jeunes femmes de Ouagadougou et de Gu&#xe9;diawaye.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes of this project include: (1) increased young women&apos;s confidence in their entrepreneurial potential in Ouagadougou and Gu&#xe9;diawaye; and (2) increased commitment (positive attitude) of community actors to women&#x2019;s entrepreneurship and valuable work for young women in Ouagadougou and Gu&#xe9;diawaye.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
